	(text "3V3: SY8089AAAC sync buck, Vout = 0.6 x (1 + R7/R8) = 3.33 V, C7 feed-forward.\nEN UVLO R16/R17 150K/100K: EN = 2.0 V at 5 V, crosses V_EN,H (1.5 V) at ~3.75 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "03743ec5-06ea-420c-9696-d6e728bd28ae")
	)
	(text "5 V in: J6 (native USB-C) -> VBUS_USB -> F1 polyfuse -> D1 Schottky -> VBUS rail.\nD1 blocks back-feed into J6 when the board is powered from J3 (PIO-USB).\nVBUS rail feeds J3 VBUS (5 V to the USB device), HDMI +5V (D3), audio SPKVDD and the 3V3 buck (C2/C4 at its input).\nD4 feeds HDMI +5V (M_HV_5V) straight from VBUS_USB_F, one diode drop instead of two."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.79 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ec1535a3-e7ba-4300-a727-f25c8a7e6e7e")
	)
